#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:3
#: 47a07297a0c74ba0833676d121ec7c59
msgid "成分扫描（Composition Sweep）"
msgstr "Composition Sweep"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:5
#: fba3965feadd4a9b91561163f0f84f89
msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `CompositionSweepCard`"
msgstr "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `CompositionSweepCard`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:7
#: 25a7e86296d04089b618398e3960c9c4
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:9
#: ac3f3d30ba174c989e0337bb4f8a59f2
msgid ""
"在元素池和元数约束下生成成分设计空间。对选定元素集合按二元到五元组合展开，用网格或 Sobol 低差异序列在 simplex 上采样目标配比点，输出带 "
"`Comp(...)` 标签的结构副本。本卡只生成目标配比计划，不真正落位——需要下游接 `Random Occupancy` 才能得到离散原子占位。"
msgstr ""
"Generate a composition design space from an element pool and selected "
"component counts. The card expands binary through quinary combinations and "
"samples target fractions on each simplex with a grid or Sobol sequence. It "
"outputs structure copies labeled `Comp(...)`; these labels are composition "
"plans, not actual site occupations. Follow with `Random Occupancy` to assign"
" discrete species."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:11
#: e3549a8ff48a493488b3059ae204b3d7
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:13
#: 435133777f5844b1bf8bb2bcecdd9a18
msgid "场景：模型在偏离训练集化学计量比时预测崩了"
msgstr "Scenario: Predictions fail away from the training stoichiometry"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:15
#: 55c1bf4112f847c6991ffa21f0b8cfa9
msgid ""
"你在 Co-Cr-Ni 三元系上训练了一个 NEP 模型，训练数据全部来自等摩尔 CoCrNi 单相。模型对等摩尔构型的能量和力预测很好，但一跑 "
"Co30Cr20Ni50 这种偏离等摩尔的组分，能量误差翻了三倍。诊断结果是：训练集所有数据的成分落在 simplex "
"的一个点上，模型根本没有见过成分变化导致的局域化学环境差异。"
msgstr ""
"A Co-Cr-Ni NEP is trained entirely on equiatomic CoCrNi. It performs well "
"there, but its energy error triples at a composition such as Co30Cr20Ni50. "
"All training compositions occupy one point of the simplex, so composition-"
"dependent local chemistry is extrapolated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:17
#: ea5f4645e684451f85fb6d39b3ee5046
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** "
"合金模型的基本要求是能在整个成分空间内插，而不是只记住一个成分点。如果训练集成分覆盖太窄，模型只能外推——成分漂得越远，误差越大。解决办法是先在目标成分空间内均匀撒一批配比点，再去下游逐个落位，让模型从头学起不同成分下的化学环境。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** An alloy model should interpolate across the intended "
"composition domain, not memorize one composition. First design a well-"
"distributed set of target fractions, then realize each target with "
"downstream site occupation so the training set contains distinct chemical "
"environments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:19
#: e59788277d564dfc80a2f77de4c3f279
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 CoCrNi 超胞结构（当前训练集里唯一的结构，等摩尔配比）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A relaxed equiatomic CoCrNi supercell, currently the only "
"training composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:21
#: fdec769aa1404bc2a9ff3845d3d69a73
msgid ""
"**目标：** 从 Co-Cr-Ni 三个元素出发，生成二元 + 三元所有配比的网格采样，约 500 个目标配比点，后续接 `Random "
"Occupancy` 落地"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Grid-sample all binary and ternary Co-Cr-Ni combinations up "
"to about 500 targets, then realize them with `Random Occupancy`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:23
#: 4423205f755d411bad26781adb2703a4
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:24
#: d40557d8bea74b00857b71f41b5a5236
msgid "`elements` = `Co,Cr,Ni`"
msgstr "`elements` = `Co,Cr,Ni`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:25
#: 55a31c9edffc43fb8a4f04edd895bd6b
msgid "`order` = `2,3` （二元 + 三元组合）"
msgstr "`order` = `2,3` (binary and ternary combinations)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:26
#: 54cd75585e0149c9a102cc91c1e5754c
msgid "`method` = `Grid`，`step` = `0.1`"
msgstr "`method` = `Grid`，`step` = `0.1`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:27
#: d61ab9dcc879419881085ce39cd93d6c
msgid "`max_outputs` = `500`"
msgstr "`max_outputs` = `500`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:29
#: cbbc259a450843829186c30f6cfd1fd2
msgid "**输出：** 约 500 个带 `Comp(Co=...,Cr=...,Ni=...)` 标签的结构副本。此时结构内原子种类未变，标签只是目标配比计划"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** About 500 structure copies labeled `Comp(Co=...,Cr=...,Ni=...)`."
" Atomic species are unchanged at this stage; the label records only the "
"target composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:31
#: f0c9e2b4cf6a477c815a0c710535f4c9
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:32
#: 9ccbe03c31dc40cc965ca701b5361d78
msgid "重训后跑几个偏移等摩尔的测试组分，力的 MAE 应该不再随成分漂移而显著恶化"
msgstr ""
"After realization, labeling, and retraining, force MAE at several off-"
"equiatomic tests should no longer deteriorate sharply with composition "
"distance."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:33
#: 21468331fd6149a7ab3c6c7332db7e0f
msgid ""
"检查 `Config_type` 中 Comp 标签的成分分布是否覆盖了 simplex 各区域——如果某些边角空白，减小 step 或换 Sobol "
"补点"
msgstr ""
"Plot the `Comp` fractions from `Config_type` and confirm coverage across "
"each simplex. Reduce the grid step or use Sobol if corners or regions remain"
" empty."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:34
#: c8d60f921af647f9b1bec9f5f4dd03cd
msgid "如果全部集中等摩尔附近但没有边角覆盖，打开 `include_endpoints`，降低 `min_fraction` 到 0"
msgstr ""
"If points cluster near equiatomic compositions and omit boundaries, enable "
"`include_endpoints` and set `min_fraction` to 0."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:35
#: 4d6dca462e7f460abc62a744d6f08ce0
msgid ""
"如果输出量不够覆盖所有 order 组合，提高 `max_outputs`，或把 `budget_mode` 换成 `Capacity-"
"weighted` 让高元数组合分到更多名额"
msgstr ""
"If the output budget undersamples some orders, raise `max_outputs` or choose"
" `Capacity-weighted` so higher-order simplexes receive more points."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:37
#: c20348a3b6684241bf04120f0bee08bf
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:39
#: 0f79bd62d6c04a47aaf4bf22d12a4f81
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:40
#: 779d4e1aa985457e96dc8331901d4ae6
msgid "模型在偏离训练集化学计量比时误差显著增大"
msgstr "Model error grows markedly away from the training stoichiometry"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:41
#: ac458d6200384ea796a15c7d4f1d04aa
msgid "需要系统覆盖二元到多元合金成分空间，而非少量随机掺杂"
msgstr "A binary-to-multicomponent composition space needs systematic coverage"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:42
#: 8ed48c41e8ad43c88ba94fe654f8b13f
msgid "作为合金 pipeline 的第一步，先定义配比，再接占位卡片"
msgstr "An alloy workflow needs target fractions before site occupation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:44
#: d72beeac7a79453abe9cb446283b4c26
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:45
#: 269e7ea8d3854da1b1cf54608446c66b
msgid "只需单一固定化学计量比的结构"
msgstr "Only one fixed stoichiometry is needed"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:46
#: 06842b68782942c1bedac736ee4499d5
msgid "已经有明确掺杂规则且不需要扫配比空间 → 直接用 `Random Doping`"
msgstr ""
"A specific doping rule is already known and no composition scan is needed; "
"use `Random Doping`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:47
#: 14634a3b992c4382a83846ccb6c0360b
msgid "需要增补的是同一成分下的不同原子排布 → 直接用 `Random Occupancy`"
msgstr ""
"Only atomic arrangements at one composition are missing; use `Random "
"Occupancy`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:49
#: 8677635bc0fe498a99ad3a1d63302c28
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:51
#: 00e34b35b1a34baa99a1a84395ad1ea7
msgid "Elements（elements）"
msgstr "Elements（elements）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:53
#: 28e877410f354cf5918b3b0a99e3747a
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Co,Cr,Ni`。逗号分隔的元素列表，如 `Co,Cr,Ni,Al,Fe`。至少需要 2 个元素，程序会从中取出所有 n "
"元组合做配比扫描。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Co,Cr,Ni`. Comma-separated element pool, for example "
"`Co,Cr,Ni,Al,Fe`. At least two elements are required; the card forms all "
"requested n-component subsets."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:55
#: 0d66b0abfde24f338a478391a92407e4
msgid "Order（order）"
msgstr "Order（order）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:57
#: 0e5e86bf78b6480c81d18b10ffee8112
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `2,3,4,5`。按逗号分隔的整数列表决定扫描哪些元数的组合，只支持 2/3/4/5 元。也兼容旧版名称如 "
"`Binary`、`Ternary+Quaternary`。`2,3` 适合快速覆盖，`2,3,4,5` 适合系统性高熵探索。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `2,3,4,5`. Comma-separated component counts; supported values"
" are 2, 3, 4, and 5. Legacy names such as `Binary` and `Ternary+Quaternary` "
"are accepted. Use `2,3` for a compact design and all orders for systematic "
"high-entropy exploration."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:59
#: 283bf229f40a4f71868eaf9b057d53e6
msgid "Method（method）"
msgstr "Method（method）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:61
#: c1ac89c3d647418588bbf93cf7ccc488
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Grid`。`Grid` 用均匀网格采样，步长可控，适合低元数（2-3 元）。`Sobol` 用低差异序列在高维 simplex "
"上覆盖更均匀，适合 4-5 元或点数有限的情况。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Grid`. `Grid` uses a controlled uniform step and is "
"convenient for binary or ternary spaces. `Sobol` gives more even limited-"
"point coverage of four- or five-component simplexes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:63
#: b9f8fd376a6d4233bc38aa5ea2422a43
msgid "Step（step）"
msgstr "Step（step）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:65
#: e23510dbae8a4d1e99b3e5570170f080
msgid "`float`，默认 0.1，仅 Grid 模式生效。控制 simplex 网格分辨率——越小点越密、输出越多。典型值 0.05-0.15。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.1`; Grid only. Simplex grid spacing. Smaller values "
"produce denser and larger outputs; 0.05-0.15 is a typical starting range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:67
#: 3e48f20ed134410cbcd19a1c1594db00
msgid "N Points（n_points）"
msgstr "N Points（n_points）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:69
#: 8e362b02559143d7a11996cabc71adf8
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 50，仅 Sobol 模式生效。它表示通过 `min_fraction` "
"约束后的目标有效点数，而不是过滤前的尝试数。operation 会继续补采样直到得到该数量；典型值 25-200。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 50; used only in Sobol mode. This is the target number of "
"valid points after applying `min_fraction`, not the number of attempts "
"before filtering. The operation continues sampling until it reaches that "
"target. Typical values are 25-200."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:71
#: 6d08d97c0bd1448199ab1fde7a3c66ec
msgid "Min Fraction（min_fraction）"
msgstr "Min Fraction（min_fraction）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:73
#: 1354d42d57634842af95d31de2078900
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.0，范围 0-1。每个元素的最小占比下限。比如设为 0.05 意味着每个组分至少 5%，极端稀释的端点成分会被自动过滤掉。设 "
"0 则不做下限约束。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0`, range 0-1. Minimum fraction of every included "
"element. A value of 0.05 removes compositions below 5%; zero imposes no "
"lower bound."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:75
#: fc52fc5defbb4486b378a9df05c7efb8
msgid "Include Endpoints（include_endpoints）"
msgstr "Include Endpoints（include_endpoints）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:77
#: 7f9a3ce8d208400cb209d3de0d3e0a01
msgid "`bool`，默认 true，仅 Grid 模式。勾选后保留纯端点及边界成分点，关掉则跳过这些点。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`; Grid only. Keep pure endpoints and boundary "
"compositions when enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:79
#: 18c6563a6a1c4597973f57de66e78dfe
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Seed（use_seed）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:81
#: d035c3184f0f4e7bb0e8951448f34329
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定随机路径（Sobol 生成和组合选取），同参数同输入可复现。对比实验时打开，探索阶段可以关着。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Fix Sobol generation and combination selection for "
"reproducible controlled comparisons."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:83
#: 79cd1b849a964f3086b2d9dbf3fbc6ed
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr "Seed（seed）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:85
#: c844a2eec73f4ca6a985f2fba442b7f1
msgid "`int`，默认 0。不同取值产生不同的采样分布。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`. Different values produce different sample designs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:87
#: cb6783727014495a97aeb36ae1865350
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:89
#: a391ff76f2014250a5b6e25a056ef37f
msgid "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:91
#: 0075ba1cf06b4d259d06fa4c4e15349e
msgid "`int`，默认 500。输出总上限，防止组合爆炸。超出预算时按 `budget_mode` 规则分配到各 order。典型值 250-1500。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `500`. Global output cap. When capacity exceeds it, "
"`budget_mode` allocates points among orders. Values around 250-1500 are "
"typical."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:93
#: 638812fc60be4c74aa3a89cba1c9e20f
msgid "Budget Mode（budget_mode）"
msgstr "Budget Mode（budget_mode）"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:95
#: 5fa9cbcb48084b9a963233ed8c71cc10
msgid "`str`，默认 `Equal+Reflow`。控制超出预算时如何在不同元数之间分配名额。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Equal+Reflow`. Allocation policy when the requested design "
"exceeds the budget."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:97
#: d50287ff27cd46afb7281e82aa4b85eb
msgid "`Equal+Reflow`：各 order 均分，余量回流，适合大多数场景。"
msgstr ""
"`Equal+Reflow`: split equally, then reassign unused capacity; suitable for "
"most designs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:98
#: 508144754f644e2597682e1267318f53
msgid "`Capacity-weighted`：按各 order 的理论容量加权分配，高元数分到更多名额。"
msgstr ""
"`Capacity-weighted`: allocate by theoretical capacity, favoring higher-"
"component orders."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:99
#: c9dda5ac98fc49e695caeccf0f22c095
msgid "`Equal (Legacy)`：旧版均分，不做余量回流。"
msgstr "`Equal (Legacy)`: old equal split without reflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:101
#: 3a8793e88c3a4c6b9f17ae6c29dfb523
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:103
#: 08164b2973bb4d0bb61065528a2eb70e
msgid "快速试探（二元+三元 Grid，~100 点）"
msgstr "Quick survey (binary and ternary Grid, about 100 points)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:104
#: b2cb8cce504f4cf2bb58b6e9be057247
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CompositionSweepCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"elements\": \"Co,Cr,Ni\",\n"
"  \"order\": \"2,3\",\n"
"  \"method\": \"Grid\",\n"
"  \"step\": [0.1],\n"
"  \"n_points\": [50],\n"
"  \"min_fraction\": [0.0],\n"
"  \"include_endpoints\": true,\n"
"  \"use_seed\": false,\n"
"  \"seed\": [0],\n"
"  \"max_outputs\": [100],\n"
"  \"budget_mode\": \"Equal+Reflow\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CompositionSweepCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"elements\": \"Co,Cr,Ni\",\n"
"  \"order\": \"2,3\",\n"
"  \"method\": \"Grid\",\n"
"  \"step\": [0.1],\n"
"  \"n_points\": [50],\n"
"  \"min_fraction\": [0.0],\n"
"  \"include_endpoints\": true,\n"
"  \"use_seed\": false,\n"
"  \"seed\": [0],\n"
"  \"max_outputs\": [100],\n"
"  \"budget_mode\": \"Equal+Reflow\"\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:122
#: a218ff4067a947c29b911af9526e4afc
msgid "常规覆盖（全组合 Grid，~500 点）"
msgstr "Routine coverage (all combinations, Grid, about 500 points)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:123
#: 6e9b9eea657d4ee3ab210222115cb2ca
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CompositionSweepCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"elements\": \"Co,Cr,Ni,Al\",\n"
"  \"order\": \"2,3,4,5\",\n"
"  \"method\": \"Grid\",\n"
"  \"step\": [0.1],\n"
