#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:160
#: 0e8b83f015754c50a1768c3c3ecb6fbe
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:162
#: b16d704af291473d8203d78135cf423c
msgid ""
"`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy`：先定义目标配比，再落到离散原子占位。合金 pipeline "
"的标准起手式。"
msgstr ""
"`Composition Sweep` -> `Random Occupancy`: define target fractions, then "
"realize discrete occupations; the standard alloy workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:163
#: 45defed5997d482f9496d3f4891a7dc3
msgid ""
"`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy` → `Random Doping`：配比覆盖 + 占位多样性 + "
"额外局部替位。"
msgstr ""
"`Composition Sweep` -> `Random Occupancy` -> `Random Doping`: composition "
"coverage, occupation diversity, then additional local substitutions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:164
#: 53cff990b12b417c9f70e800224a0138
msgid "`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy` → `Atomic Perturb`：成分 + 占位 + 坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`Composition Sweep` -> `Random Occupancy` -> `Atomic Perturb`: composition, "
"occupation, and coordinate noise."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:166
#: 96e631d0000641da9ad94967ea5c7987
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:168
#: 222e0f181b9c40f285020a65d2b328d5
msgid "**输出和输入完全一样。** `elements` 少于 2 个元素，或 `order` 不合法，或 `max_outputs` <= 0。"
msgstr ""
"**Output is unchanged.** Check that `elements` has at least two entries, "
"`order` is supported, and `max_outputs` is positive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:170
#: 754e09ab0af64579a266f156f5f70b07
msgid ""
"**标签成分和原子实际组成不一致。** 正常——Composition Sweep 只打目标配比标签，不改原子种类。需要接 `Random "
"Occupancy` 才会真正替换原子。"
msgstr ""
"**Label fractions differ from actual species counts.** This is expected: "
"Composition Sweep records a plan but does not replace atoms. Add `Random "
"Occupancy` to realize it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:172
#: 1178611f2ead4e99b328dd5c54853b61
msgid "**组合爆炸。** 5 元 + Grid + step=0.05 可产生上万个点。先用 `max_outputs` 卡住上限，小样本验证后再放量。"
msgstr ""
"**Combinatorial explosion.** A five-component Grid at step 0.05 can contain "
"tens of thousands of points. Set `max_outputs`, validate a small design, "
"then increase it deliberately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:174
#: 8e52c8d954a34ea8be49dadc8959ae68
msgid ""
"**某些 order 没有输出。** 检查 `budget_mode` 分配和 element 数量。只有 3 个元素但 order 含 4 和 5 "
"时，程序自动跳过不可执行的组合。"
msgstr ""
"**Some orders have no output.** Check budget allocation and the element "
"count. With only three elements, orders 4 and 5 are skipped."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:176
#: db7774936d7640f49d8d86d6f2925608
msgid ""
"**Sobol + min_fraction 报告有效点不足。** 下限越接近等摩尔值 `1/order`，可接受区域越小。operation "
"会在明确的尝试预算内补采样；仍不足时抛出 `ValueError`，报告实际接受点数、目标点数和尝试次数，不会静默返回少量结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Sobol + min_fraction reports too few valid points.** The closer the lower "
"bound is to the equimolar value `1/order`, the smaller the admissible region"
" becomes. The operation resamples within an explicit attempt budget. If the "
"target is still not reached, it raises `ValueError` with the accepted count,"
" target count, and attempt count instead of silently returning a small "
"dataset."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:178
#: c357fcbb264844d7b50390577cd67ee7
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:180
#: 695b30ded4844627856b9bfc8cfa99dc
msgid "`Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)` 格式。每个输出结构通过 `Config_type` 携带目标配比。"
msgstr ""
"Format: `Comp(Co=0.3333,Cr=0.3333,Ni=0.3333)`. Each output carries its "
"target fractions in `Config_type`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:182
#: d12dd0f2f89449a08915b5f09896c914
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-sweep-card.md:184
#: 6a573aa1d6f54de48c4ba2088800515b
msgid ""
"勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入顺序可复现。Grid 模式的网格点本身是确定性的，`use_seed` "
"主要影响组合选取顺序和 Sobol 生成。"
msgstr ""
"Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce an input order. Grid points "
"are deterministic; the seed mainly affects subset selection and Sobol "
"generation."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 50，仅 Sobol 模式生效。目标采样点数，典型值 25-200。"
#~ msgstr "`int`, default `50`; Sobol only. Requested sample count, commonly 25-200."
